@DS.DeviceService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5228

### Get All Devices
GET {{DS.DeviceService_HostAddress}}/devices
Accept: application/json

### Create Device
POST {{DS.DeviceService_HostAddress}}/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceName": "Smart Meter Living Room",
  "consumptionValue": 250,
  "userId": null
}

### Get Device By ID (replace with real id)
GET {{DS.DeviceService_HostAddress}}/devices/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Get All Devices For a User (1:N lookup)
GET {{DS.DeviceService_HostAddress}}/devices/user/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Assign Device to User
PATCH {{DS.DeviceService_HostAddress}}/devices/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/assign/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Unassign Device
PATCH {{DS.DeviceService_HostAddress}}/devices/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/unassign
Accept: application/json

### Delete Device
DELETE {{DS.DeviceService_HostAddress}}/devices/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
